# WaveFront *.mtl file
# Configured for Premium Matte Metallic Black Finish

newmtl Steel_-_Satin
Ka 0.050000 0.050000 0.050000        # Low ambient reflection to keep shadows deep black
Kd 0.120000 0.130000 0.150000        # Diffuse surface color (Deep Charcoal/Black base)
Ks 0.250000 0.250000 0.250000        # Subdued specular glare for a non-glossy, metallic sheen
Ns 12.000000                         # Low roughness/tightness value to scatter highlights (Matte)
d 1.000000                           # Fully solid opacity